{"task_id": "HumanEval/62", "solution": "def derivative(xs: list):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the derivative of a polynomial represented by coefficients.\n    The output list contains coefficients of the derived polynomial.\"\"\"\n    derived_coeffs = []\n    # Iterate from the coefficient of x^1 upwards\n    # The derivative of c*x^n is c*n*x^(n-1)\n    # The constant term (xs[0]) differentiates to 0 and is dropped.\n    for i in range(1, len(xs)):\n        derived_coeffs.append(xs[i] * i)\n    return derived_coeffs"}
